WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:23.600
This is Major.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.360
I'm on site.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.880
I'm going in.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.060
You are the first of your kind.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:54.220
But you're not invulnerable.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.420
May be next time you can design me better.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:05.380
Every one around me, they feel connected to something.

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.540
Connected to something that I'm ...

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:11.260
not.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:15.460
What are you?

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:21.880
You were dying.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:24.940
We saved you.

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:27.420
And now you save others.

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:45.660
I don't know who to trust.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:47.320
You can trust me, right?

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.100
I know I have a past.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.620
I will find out who I was.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:07.140
Everything they told you was a lie.

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:08.580
Who are you?

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.360
They did not save your life.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.120
They stole it.

